<title>USA: First Union says to lead banks financing ShoLodge.</title>
<headline>First Union says to lead banks financing ShoLodge.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets Corp, in conjunction with First Union National Bank of Tennessee said Friday it will lead a group of five banks providing $75 million in financing to Gallatin, Tenn.-based ShoLodge Inc to help fuel the multi-state hotel chain's continued expansion during the next three years.</p>
<p>ShoLodge develops and operates mid-priced, all-suites hotels under the Sumner Suites brand name, and is also the exclusive franchisor of Shoney's Inns.</p>
